</section>


<section class="section page-section" aria-labelledby="community-title">
  <div class="container split-layout">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Why community matters</p><h2 id="community-title">Infrastructure is also a social system</h2></div>
    <div class="prose"><p>Research infrastructure succeeds when people can understand it, contribute to it, and see how decisions are made. That requires more than a usable interface.</p><p>We create practical ways for maintainers, researchers, educators, and new contributors to exchange knowledge and influence direction.</p></div>
